<Positioned left="1456" top="770"><Container width="12" height="12" color="#D97706FF" borderRadius="3"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1474" top="768"><Text fontSize="13" color="#64748BFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="NORMAL">Coastal-Meso</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="812"><Container width="700" height="150" color="#FFFFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E2E8F0FF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="830"><Text fontSize="15" color="#64748BFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="2">WHY THE MORNING AND NOT THE AFTERNOON</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66.5" top="862.5"><Container width="7.0" height="7.0" color="#1D4ED8FF" shape="CIRCLE"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="858"><Text fontSize="16" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The sea builds through the day: 0.4 m at 06:00, 0.8 m by 18:00 on the same wind.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66.5" top="890.5"><Container width="7.0" height="7.0" color="#1D4ED8FF" shape="CIRCLE"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="886"><Text fontSize="16" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Gusts reach 26 kn after 15:00 — over the 18 kn abort line in the passage plan.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66.5" top="918.5"><Container width="7.0" height="7.0" color="#1D4ED8FF" shape="CIRCLE"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="914"><Text fontSize="16" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The bank gate closes at 08:10; a late start wastes the morning tide.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="760" top="812"><Container width="800" height="150" color="#0B1B2BFF" borderRadius="14"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="784" top="830"><Text fontSize="15" color="#5EEAD4FF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="2">DECISION</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="784" top="854"><Text fontSize="26" color="#FFFFFFFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">Launch 06:25 · cross out 06:35 · back over the bank 14:58</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="784" top="898"><Text fontSize="17" color="#94A3B8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Sunday's plan is cancelled; Monday 06:00–12:00 is the fallback window (W 11–13 kn, 0.4 m).</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="784" top="926"><Text fontSize="17" color="#FCD34DFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">If the 06:00 inshore update shows gusts over 18 kn before 10:00, the day is off.</Text></Positioned>
